      "property_ref": "bounded-coordinator-recovery",
      "inspiration_ref": "timer-symmetry-liveness",
      "summary": "While the sole client write is inflight at n1, natural pulses on n2 and then n3 start competing ballots before either lower-priority node can complete a quorum. Promise evidence moves leadership n1-\u003en2-\u003en3; the trigger is whether a decision still advances from the final aligned ballot within the investigation bound.",
      "suspected_mechanism": "invoke-n1 [workload-invoked]: The client operation starts at n1, the configured coordinator, and creates the inflight log entry that competing ballots must eventually decide. -\u003e tick-n2 [temporal-fired]: A natural pulse on n2 advances its election timer and starts a competing ballot before n1's quorum completes. -\u003e n1-promise-to-n2 [omnipaxos/promise-raised]: n1 observes n2's ballot and raises a promise, releasing the old leadership and exposing the accepted suffix to the new ballot. -\u003e tick-n3 [temporal-fired]: A natural pulse on n3 starts another competing ballot before n2 can marshal its quorum, keeping the leadership unstable. -\u003e n2-promise-to-n3 [omnipaxos/promise-raised]: n2 receives n3's higher ballot and raises a promise, so the final coordinator's evidence is assembled across two transitions. -\u003e decide-at-n3 [decision-advanced]: A decision from the final ballot is the falsifiable recovery outcome: if aligned pulses prevent it, recovery is not bounded.",
